60433c91c49224be55081deaa316e534b1da73f66e5bf8f70fb3c62f","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"当地的道路交通混乱不堪，各类机动车、三轮车和行人挤作一团，谁也不让谁。"},{"hook":"印度人穿越拥堵的非凡天赋","start":246.552,"ende":266.64,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":5925447,"byte_ende":6407558,"bytes":482112,"range_header":"bytes=5925447-6407558","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":246.624,"anker_sha256":"df3d5e619128b77c45f79535884d24d025a23f38abde745b215af0a3de5013a1","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"面对没有红绿灯和交警的拥堵街巷，当地人却总能迅速找到缝隙穿行，效率极高。"},{"hook":"政府建露天厕所对抗随地大小便","start":377.856,"ende":397.944,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":9076743,"byte_ende":9558854,"bytes":482112,"range_header":"bytes=9076743-9558854","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":377.928,"anker_sha256":"58b409c9db098cf223ec01f78d4fb7669494464ac0d0d61f21654fb46db8a562","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"针对男性随地小便的现象，当地政府修建了简陋的露天厕所试图改善城市形象。"},{"hook":"十几公里外的隐秘富人区","start":568.584,"ende":594.072,"laenge":25.49,"byte_start":13654215,"byte_ende":14265926,"bytes":611712,"range_header":"bytes=13654215-14265926","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":568.656,"anker_sha256":"056640e18dd599b35f9f4202e9a72090aa3024f67133079a2c6a5b4417b8d0c1","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"新德里戒备森严的高档住宅区内绿树成荫、豪车云集，与十几公里外破败的旧德里形成鲜明对比。"}],"erzeugt":{"am":"2026-08-24T12:55:52+00:00","transkript_modell":"faster-whisper large-v3","transkript_quelle":"whisper","verstehen_modell":"gemini-flash-lite-latest","prompt_version":2},"sprache":"zh","texte_sprache":"zh","texte_herkunft":"erzeugt","dauer":622,"veroeffentlicht":"2020-08-28T14:11:54+00:00","beschreibung":"感谢你的关注和不离不弃，欢迎关注、点赞、转发，关注公众号“严肃的扯 小众旅行漫记”，有我所有的旅行故事、攻略、照片~~~","bild_url":"https://fdfs.xmcdn.com/group47/M03/57/81/wKgKk1ufXy_ATmzpAATu5as2ukw150.jpg","folgennummer":1,"kapitel_quelle":"modell"}